                <p rendition="#flush">Sailings on this order would fail to meet Protocol
                    requirements in July by 56 ships, but would permit meeting full commitments by
                    the end of the calendar year.</p>
                <p>7. It will be noted from Tables I and II that the following additional sailings
                    would be required for such a program resulting in the necessity for the use of
                    additional cargo ships for the period of a year.</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Table</hi> III</p>
