            <note corresp="#d411-f1" n="1" xml:id="d411-f1-content">
                <p>With the exception of paragraphs 14 and 15, the revisions of which were discussed
                    and agreed upon at the meeting of the Combined Chiefs of Staff on the morning of
                    January 20 (<hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg656">p.
                    656</ref>), this paper is identical with the earlier version, C.C.S. 162,
                    January 19, 1943, not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d411-f2" n="2" xml:id="d411-f2-content">
                <p>Regarding the Second (Washington) Soviet Supply Protocol of October 6, 1942, see
